## Cancellation Rule

Customer cancellation is allowed only when BOTH conditions are true:

1. Status is Pending.
2. Less than or equal to 2 hours have passed since order creation.

Once the order becomes Processing, cancellation is no longer allowed.

## Cancellation Process

On Cancel:
- Show confirmation modal.
- Revalidate status and time.
- Set order status to Cancelled.
- Restore stock to each purchased variant.
- Remove order from the Customer active orders list.
- Keep the order in Admin records.

Stock must not be restored twice.

## Empty State

